*  KW-9 witness: a PLAIN (non-&) variable that happens to share a keyword's
*  name is an ORDINARY VARIABLE, and an unset one reads as the NULL STRING.
*  Manual: keywords are set apart by the unary & operator (Ch.16 opening); the
*  bare spellings carry no keyword meaning at all.
*  This pins the ARMED default, where the NV_GET_fn bare-name hijack family
*  (core.c ~2200: STNO/STLIMIT/ANCHOR/TRIM/FULLSCAN/CASE/MAXLNGTH/FTRACE/
*  TRACE/ERRLIMIT/CODE) is bypassed.  On the LEGACY arm (SCRIP_KW_STATIC=0)
*  every row below is ORACLE-WRONG -- MAXLNGTH reads 524288 and the rest read
*  0 -- which is the measured correctness case for retiring that arm (KW-4).
	OUTPUT = 'MAXLNGTH=[' MAXLNGTH ']'
	OUTPUT = 'TRACE=[' TRACE ']'
	OUTPUT = 'STCOUNT=[' STCOUNT ']'
	OUTPUT = 'STNO=[' STNO ']'
	OUTPUT = 'ANCHOR=[' ANCHOR ']'
	OUTPUT = 'TRIM=[' TRIM ']'
	OUTPUT = 'FULLSCAN=[' FULLSCAN ']'
	OUTPUT = 'ERRLIMIT=[' ERRLIMIT ']'
END
